    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-ps20">
        <head xml:id="gom-ps20-Hd1e98">Psalmus 20</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps20-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps20-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps20-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps20_1@1-2">In finem.</quote>
            Tertius psalmus de duabus naturis in Christo, coelestem regem describit, ut auditu credat mundus, quem visum contemnit Judaeus. Demonstrativam facit orationem in laudem Dei.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps20-Dd1e111">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps20-Hd1e113">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps20-d1e115">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e117" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps20_2@1-5">Domine in virtute tua laetabitur.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps20-Rd1e120"><name xml:id="gom-ps20-Nd1e121" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e124">Summam proponit, scilicet, meritum et praemium.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps20-Dd1e128">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps20-Hd1e130">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps20-d1e132">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e134" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps20_4@1-2">Quoniam praevenisti.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps20-Rd1e137"><name xml:id="gom-ps20-Nd1e138" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e141"><seg type="qs">Diapsalma; virtutes ejus et gloriam describit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quasi capiti in coronam.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps20-d1e149">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e151" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps20_4@12-12">Coronam.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps20-Rd1e154"><name xml:id="gom-ps20-Nd1e155" ref="#Cassiodorus">Ibid.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e158">Quia circumitus <pb ed="#P" n="0873A"/> Apostolorum docentem ambiebat, vel totus mundi circulus, id est, Ecclesia generalis.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps20-Dd1e165">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps20-Hd1e167">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps20-d1e169">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e171" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps20_6@5-12">In salutari tuo: gloriam et magnum decorem,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps20-Rd1e174"><name xml:id="gom-ps20-Nd1e175" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e178">Verbo Patris, quae inde gloria.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps20-d1e181">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e183" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps20_6@3-3">Gloriam</quote>
            de judicio, quia in Deitate judicabit.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps20-d1e187">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e189" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps20_6@12-12">Decorem</quote>
            in majestate, quae tunc apparebit.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps20-d1e193">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e195" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps20_6@9-12">Gloriam et magnum decorem,</quote>
            etc. Gloriosus, ut Petrus, cujus umbra infirmi sanabantur; et decor est <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e198" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps20_6@14-15">super eum,</quote> praeter quem non est aliud fundamentum. Ideo <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e201" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps20_6@14-15">super eum,</quote> quoniam dabis . . . . .
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps20-Dd1e207">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps20-Hd1e209">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps20-d1e211">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e213" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps20_8@1-8">In gaudio cum vultu tuo. Quoniam rex sperat in Domino, et in misericordia,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps20-Rd1e216"><name xml:id="gom-ps20-Nd1e217" ref="#Cassiodorus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e220">. Id est, de hoc quod sui gaudebunt cum tua praesentia, quando eris omnia in omnibus.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps20-Dd1e224">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps20-Hd1e226">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps20-d1e228">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e230" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps20_9@1-3">Inveniatur manus tua,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps20-Rd1e233"><name xml:id="gom-ps20-Nd1e234" ref="#Cassiodorus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e237">De <pb ed="#P" n="0873B"/> poenis inimicorum, ut supra de laudibus Christi.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps20-Dd1e244">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps20-Hd1e246">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps20-d1e248">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e250" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps20_11@1-8">Fructum eorum de terra perdes, et semen eorum.</quote>
            Non erit eis fructus beatitudinis in terra viventium.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps20-Dd1e255">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps20-Hd1e257">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps20-d1e259">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e261" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps20_13@1-2">Quoniam pones.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps20-Rd1e264"><name xml:id="gom-ps20-Nd1e265" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e268"><seg type="qs">Dicta de futura</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ut cum putarent occidere, salus fieret.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps20-Dd1e277">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps20-Hd1e279">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps20-d1e281">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e283" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps20_14@1-1">Exaltare.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps20-Rd1e286"><name xml:id="gom-ps20-Nd1e287" ref="#Cassiodorus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps20-Qd1e290">Conclusio.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
